{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version of <i>Qurtys</i>, you can get a first impression of the game.<br>The full version includes additional cards and unlockable characters, offering plenty of variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features over 120 unique cards, including more than 30 with special effects.<br>There are also four distinct Animal Tribes that synergize with one another in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Qurtys</i> is a roguelike game each run is different, and you always start from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategy:</strong><br>Your goal is to generate as much money as possible to progress and play powerful cards.<br>You'll need a well-thought-out strategy and a bit of luck to draw the right cards at the right time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3705560?t=1746263642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705560/ff80dd61aa40fedd5a290061e51dcf58526d90ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746263642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705560/11c1315bf8b806998841d2ddc7ce0ade3d9d4dcd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746263642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705560/11c1315bf8b806998841d2ddc7ce0ade3d9d4dcd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746263642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version of <i>Qurtys</i>, you can get a first impression of the game.<br>The full version includes additional cards and unlockable characters, offering plenty of variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features over 120 unique cards, including more than 30 with special effects.<br>There are also four distinct Animal Tribes that synergize with one another in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Qurtys</i> is a roguelike game each run is different, and you always start from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategy:</strong><br>Your goal is to generate as much money as possible to progress and play powerful cards.<br>You'll need a well-thought-out strategy and a bit of luck to draw the right cards at the right time.</p>","developers":["Qurtys"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3341140","name":"Qurtys"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705560/f96e7955b6bf8bbb8ef04c785a39f2f75c0d9192/header.jpg?t=1746263642","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131704,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131704/movie480.mp4?t=1746230760","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131704/movie_max.mp4?t=1746230760"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131704/3449695feb3071a94374edef6866841683791831/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746230760","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131704/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746230760","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131704/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746230760"}}],"name":"Qurtys Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Vis